{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22340","headline":"重到渭上旧居 · 白居易","name":"重到渭上旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧居清渭曲，开门当蔡渡。\n十年方一还，几欲迷归路。\n追思昔日行，感伤故游处。\n插柳作高林，种桃成老树。\n因惊成人者，尽是旧童孺。\n试问旧老人，半爲绕村墓。\n浮生同过客，前後递来去。\n白日如弄珠，出没光不住。\n人物日改变，举目悲所遇。\n回念念我身，安得不衰暮。\n朱颜销不歇，白发生无数。\n唯有山门外，三峰色如故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}